error[RB0403]: `count` might not be assigned yet when this is evaluated
  --> RB0403-entry-before-assignment.road:12:18
   |
 9 |   initial Idle
   |           ---- `Counter.Idle` is entered when `Counter` starts, and nothing before it assigns `count`
...
12 |     entry do log(count)
   |                  ^^^^^
   |
   = help: assign `count` on every way into `Counter.Idle` (a `set` in the transition, or in an `entry` that runs first), give it an initial value, or make its type optional

error[RB0403]: `a` might not be assigned yet when this is evaluated
  --> RB0403-entry-before-assignment.road:26:36
   |
24 |   initial Idle
   |           ---- `Order.Idle` is entered when `Order` starts, and nothing before it assigns `a`
...
